WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.135
-Our next guest is a talente
actor you know from such shows

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:04.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
as "The Good Lord Bird"
and "Lodge 49."

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:08.208
He stars as John Walker in "Th
Falcon and the Winter Soldier,

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is available to stream
on Disney+

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:13.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the season finale episode
available this Friday.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.081 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.716 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Stop the car!

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Brakes squeal ]

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.254 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Look. I -- I get it.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.156 line:92%
Okay? I get the attitude. I do

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:26.860
You didn't think that the shield
was going to end up here.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.660 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I get it, Bucky.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm -- I'm not trying
to be Steve.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.035 line:92%
I'm not trying to replace Steve.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:40.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just trying to be the best
Captain America I can be.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's it.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it would be
a whole lot easier

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
if I had Cap's wingmen
on my side.

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Scoffs ]

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.949 line:92%
It's always that last line

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Please welcome to the sho
Wyatt Russell.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.354 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
How are you, Wyatt?

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:55.722 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Hey, how is it going?

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm so very happy
to have you here.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:00.093 line:92%
I did not know this about you.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
I knew, obviously,
you came from an acting family

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:05.665 size:78% position:39%
and I became familiar
with you as an actor,

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:11.104
but you actually set out to be
a professional hockey player

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:17.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It was a long journey
from Los Angeles.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
I moved to Vancouver to play
when I was about 15.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
Moved to a million places
after that --

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:27.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
Colorado, Alabama,
Toronto, Vancouver.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:31.658
And I played my professional
hockey in Germany and Holland,

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.994
which I know that you spen
some time there as well.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:37.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I lived in Groningen.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Groningen?
-Yeah. [ Chuckles ]

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:43.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, yeah, I was living in
Amsterdam in my 20s.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:48.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you were living in
Groningen, which is worse.

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:50.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which is worse.
Which is a little worse.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.847
It was really cool 'cause it was
like a different...

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:58.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
Amsterdam, as you know,
is this sort of melting po

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
of all different types
of cultures

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:03.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's kind of
an insane place.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
Where I was living
was like a college town.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.527 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was really cool.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:10.730 size:88% position:44%
I lived in the red light
district in that town.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:14.634
And so it was a really different
experience for me.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:17.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we didn't --
I couldn't partake

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:22.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a lot of the fun stuff
that everybody else may have

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.343 line:92%
because we were drug teste

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:25.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know,
we couldn't lose our minds

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:28.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I don't think we were doing
necessarily the same thing

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:30.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
when we were there.
-Yeah, probably stayed safe.

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:33.887
Probably though if you're in
a college town in Groningen,

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:34.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
there was
a fair amount of Heineken.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm guessing you were at least
drinking that on tap.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
The Heineken cool bar.

00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:42.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
Absolutely.
-You're playing a characte

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:49.169
in this show that is, I guess,
safe to say, not a fan favorite.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
But that must be
one of the parts

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:52.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
that makes it
so much fun to play

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.974 line:92%
this maybe villainous elements

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.877 line:92%
-Yeah. It's -- It's a blast.

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:03.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
Part of what it was
when I had my interview

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:06.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the producers
and the director

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:10.123
was trying to figure out
something different to do

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:13.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
to bring to Captain Americ
or the Marvel Universe

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.629
in some way that I thought could
be maybe unique.

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just 'cause, you know,
you're entering

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.501 line:92%
like a pretty big machine

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:25.271
and as a cog in a wheel,
you want to help it work,

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:27.974 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
make it good.

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:29.542 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And so that was the aim.

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:31.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's the...
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.414 size:78% position:39%
The elicited response
that has been from

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:38.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Marvel fan universe
is pretty great.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:38.751 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It's kind of awesome.

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:42.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, minus
the fear of life and limb,

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:44.791 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
it's pretty good.

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, I will say
it's nice because, again,

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:48.962 line:92%
you obviously have a beard

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:52.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've seen with you a beard i
acting roles,

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:56.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
so at least you must be
slightly anonymous

00:03:56.002 --> 00:03:57.537 line:92%
because you're walking aroun

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:59.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a beard
you don't have in the show

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:01.674 line:92%
-Nobody knows. It's amazing.

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:04.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one -- I have not been
recognized one time.

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:07.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
I swear to God. Not one time
I can go anywhere.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went to a beach the other da
and I was like, you know,

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:12.318
it is a huge show and I get that
everybody's watch--

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.253 line:92%
a lot of people are watching it.

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:15.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
But -- And I admit,
I like my anonymity.

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:18.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
So my fear is that you're gonn
walk into a place

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:21.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you're not gonna be able t
observe was going on.

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:21.828 size:75% position:38% line:92%
It's part of my job.

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
I observe people
and then you see they're doing

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:27.333
and then copy this person that
you saw and they'll never know

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:29.335 line:92%
And so that's been a fear.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:32.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went to a beach
called Paradise Cove,

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:33.172 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
which is in Malibu.

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:35.475 size:81% position:41%
If you've been there,
there's lots of people

00:04:35.475 --> 00:04:37.076 size:78% position:39% line:92%
on an Easter weekend.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.077 line:92%
And I was kind of nervous.

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "Oh, man,
I don't want to do this.

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:41.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
Might kind of
end up not so good."

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:42.081 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I walked down --

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
Either I'm like,
terrible and everyone hates me

00:04:44.684 --> 00:04:46.386 line:92%
and no one wants to say hello,

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:49.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
or nobody recognizes
who I was

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:50.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just walking around
was amazing.

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:53.793 size:88% position:44%
So I prefer it this way.
-You obviously wear --

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:54.560 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It seems like people --

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's been a lot of meme
about the show.

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:59.132 size:81% position:41%
That is not uncommon
with a Marvel project.

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:02.568
But this really -- It looks like
you look less like yoursel

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:05.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
and more like
the character in "Up."

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:07.840 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I saw that.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first time a friend sent i
on social media --

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
it filtered toward me
because it was too good --

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:14.914 line:92%
I showed that to my wife,

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:17.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I thought we were going to
have a heart attack.

00:05:17.717 --> 00:05:20.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
It so -- whoever --
It's perfect.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the most perfect.
[ Laughs ]

00:05:22.388 --> 00:05:23.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so good, man.
-It really --

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:25.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you find out --
You're like -- No.

00:05:25.191 --> 00:05:27.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, don't ever
lose the beard, man,

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.761 line:92%
'cause now you've got "Up" face.

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:30.630 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've to the a future
with the Marvel Universe

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:34.734 line:92%
apparently for a very long time,

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:36.469 line:92%
'cause I know Carl's pretty old.

00:05:36.469 --> 00:05:37.837 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-[ Laughs ] That's true.

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:39.672 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:42.041 line:92%
You also -- Congratulations.

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:44.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
You and your wife
just had a baby.

00:05:44.377 --> 00:05:46.346 line:92%
Four months old, is that right

00:05:46.346 --> 00:05:47.647 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:47.647 --> 00:05:49.549 line:92%
It's the best thing of all time.

00:05:49.549 --> 00:05:50.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's everything
everyone says it is.

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:54.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why everything you do
you do because

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:56.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
you want to spend more tim
with your kid.

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:58.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's been amazing.

00:05:58.591 --> 00:05:59.859 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-You named him Prine.

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:02.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm a huge John Prine fan
myself.

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:07.600
So much so that I regretted that
it would make such a great name.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:08.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm assuming
that's why you did it?

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:14.540 size:78% position:39%
-Well, for Mer and I,
we met playing music.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.075 line:92%
Music's a big part of our lives.

00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:17.977 line:92%
And John Prine was always

00:06:17.977 --> 00:06:20.546 size:78% position:39%
one of our favorites,
if not our favorite.

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
We sang "In Spite of Ourselves
at our wedding.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.018 line:92%
And he's a big part of it.

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:28.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
And around the time --
a big part of our relationship

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:33.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
And around the time that
we found out we were pregnant,

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:34.494 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
he had passed away.

00:06:34.494 --> 00:06:36.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was, as cheesy
as it sounds,

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:40.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
his lyrics in our life
have been kind of important.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.636
He's always a person you can g
back to and you can listen to.

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:47.607
A song you've heard a hundre
times can take on new meanin

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:48.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
depending on
where you are in your life

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:54.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so we thought that Prine
was just a cool name.

00:06:54.347 --> 00:06:56.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all,
I like the way it sounds.

00:06:56.849 --> 00:07:00.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bud Prine.
It's his middle name.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:03.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
So if figured if everyone call
him Bud

00:07:03.222 --> 00:07:04.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they wonder
why they know his name,

00:07:04.724 --> 00:07:06.826
you can say, "Oh, you can
go by Prine if you want."

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:10.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a cool name.
-It's a really nice tribut

00:07:10.463 --> 00:07:12.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a really sweet thing
to hear.

00:07:12.832 --> 00:07:13.966 line:92%
Hey, man. Thanks so much.

00:07:13.966 --> 00:07:15.468 line:92%
It's really great to meet you.

00:07:15.468 --> 00:07:16.736 line:92%
And congrats on the show.

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:18.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Great to meet you too.
And take care.

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:21.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The season finale of "The
Falcon and the Winter Solider"

00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:24.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
will be released this Friday
on Disney+.

